{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07720","headline":"经七里滩 · 孟浩然","name":"经七里滩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"予奉垂堂诫，千金非所轻。\n爲多山水乐，频作泛舟行。\n五岳追向子，三湘吊屈平。\n湖经洞庭阔，江入新安清。\n复闻严陵濑，乃在兹湍路。\n叠障数百里，沿洄非一趣。\n彩翠相氛氲，别流乱奔注。\n钓矶平可坐，苔磴滑难步。\n猨饮石下潭，鸟还日边树。\n观奇恨来晚，倚櫂惜将暮。\n挥手弄潺湲，从兹洗尘虑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}